2026-01-21 05:14:10.071 | DEBUG    | Model request part: {"content": "AI-Powered Blog Platform with WordPress + GitHub Pages + SEO + Monetization\n\nProject Vibe\n\nBuild a lightweight, AI-enhanced blog platform that pairs with WordPress for backend management, deploys via GitHub Pages, and implements immediate monetization strategies for Philippine creators.\n\nCore Architecture\n\nFrontend (GitHub Pages) + WordPress (Headless CMS) + AI Integration + Monetization Layer\nTech Stack Prompt\n\n// Core Stack\nconst stack = {\n  frontend: \"Next.js/React (Static Generation)\",\n  hosting: \"GitHub Pages + GitHub Actions\",\n  backend: \"WordPress.com (Free Tier)\",\n  styling: \"Tailwind CSS + ShadCN UI\",\n  ai: \"OpenAI API + Vercel AI SDK\",\n  seo: \"next-seo + JSON-LD structured data\",\n  monetization: \"WordPress.com Payments + Affiliate APIs\",\n  deployment: \"Automatic via GitHub Actions\"\n};\nKey Features to Implement\n\nAI Integration Components\n// AI-powered writing assistant\n- Content idea generator (Philippine tech/AI trends)\n- Auto-tagging and categorization\n- SEO title/description generator\n- Local language (Filipino/English) translator\n- Content summarizer for social sharing\nMonetization Implementation\n// Monetization modules\nconst monetization = {\n  donations: {\n    provider: \"Stripe (Philippines support)\",\n    component: \"One-time payment buttons\",\n    placement: \"Article footers, sidebar widget\"\n  },\n  paidNewsletters: {\n    provider: \"WordPress.com built-in\",\n    integration: \"REST API for subscriber content\"\n  },\n  affiliateLinks: {\n    platforms: [\"Amazon PH\", \"Lazada\", \"Shopee\"],\n    components: [\"Smart link converter\", \"Disclosure banners\"]\n  },\n  sponsorships: {\n    features: [\"Sponsored post labeling\", \"Custom disclosure templates\"]\n  }\n};\nSEO & Performance\ntoast-ui-seo:\n  components:\n    - Auto-generated sitemap.xml\n    - Robots.txt optimization\n    - Open Graph meta tags\n    - Twitter card integration\n    - JSON-LD for articles\n    - Core Web Vitals optimization\n    - Lazy loading for images", "timestamp": "2026-01-21T05:14:10.067630+00:00", "part_kind": "user-prompt"}
