2026-01-21 05:21:41.663 | DEBUG    | Processing tool event with attributes: {'gen_ai.tool.name': 'create_file', 'gen_ai.tool.call.id': 'toolu_bdrk_01T3HL22HDgx5fGA7HrWvoN5', 'tool_arguments': '{"file_path": "CONTRIBUTING.md", "initial_content": "# Contributing to AI Blog Platform\\n\\nThank you for your interest in contributing! 🎉\\n\\n## How to Contribute\\n\\n### 1. Report Bugs\\n- Check if the bug is already reported in [Issues](https://github.com/yourusername/ai-blog-platform/issues)\\n- If not, create a new issue with:\\n  - Clear title\\n  - Steps to reproduce\\n  - Expected vs actual behavior\\n  - Screenshots if applicable\\n  - Your environment (OS, Node version, etc.)\\n\\n### 2. Suggest Features\\n- Open an issue with the \\"enhancement\\" label\\n- Describe the feature and its use case\\n- Explain why it would be valuable\\n\\n### 3. Submit Pull Requests\\n\\n#### Before You Start\\n1. Fork the repository\\n2. Create a new branch: `git checkout -b feature/your-feature-name`\\n3. Make sure tests pass: `npm run build`\\n\\n#### Code Style\\n- Use TypeScript for type safety\\n- Follow existing code formatting\\n- Use meaningful variable names\\n- Add comments for complex logic\\n\\n#### Commit Messages\\n- Use clear, descriptive messages\\n- Start with verb: \\"Add\\", \\"Fix\\", \\"Update\\", \\"Remove\\"\\n- Examples:\\n  - ✅ \\"Add Filipino language support to SEO optimizer\\"\\n  - ✅ \\"Fix donation widget Stripe integration\\"\\n  - ❌ \\"updates\\"\\n  - ❌ \\"fix bug\\"\\n\\n#### Pull Request Process\\n1. Update documentation if needed\\n2. Add yourself to contributors list\\n3. Create PR with clear description\\n4. Link related issues\\n5. Wait for review\\n\\n### 4. Improve Documentation\\n- Fix typos\\n- Add examples\\n- Clarify instructions\\n- Translate to Filipino\\n\\n## Development Setup\\n\\n```bash\\n# Clone your fork\\ngit clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/ai-blog-platform.git\\ncd ai-blog-platform\\n\\n# Install dependencies\\nnpm install\\n\\n# Create branch\\ngit checkout -b feature/amazing-feature\\n\\n# Make changes and test\\nnpm run dev\\n\\n# Build to ensure no errors\\nnpm run build\\n\\n# Commit and push\\ngit add .\\ngit commit -m \\"Add amazing feature\\"\\ngit push origin feature/amazing-feature\\n```\\n\\n## Areas That Need Help\\n\\n### High Priority\\n- [ ] Add comment system integration (Disqus, Giscus)\\n- [ ] Create WordPress plugin for easier setup\\n- [ ] Add more AI features (image generation, voice-to-text)\\n- [ ] Improve mobile responsiveness\\n\\n### Medium Priority\\n- [ ] Add more affiliate platform integrations\\n- [ ] Create admin dashboard for analytics\\n- [ ] Add email newsletter automation\\n- [ ] Implement A/B testing for monetization\\n\\n### Low Priority\\n- [ ] Add more themes/templates\\n- [ ] Create video tutorials\\n- [ ] Build community forum\\n- [ ] Mobile app version\\n\\n## Code of Conduct\\n\\n- Be respectful and inclusive\\n- Welcome newcomers\\n- Give constructive feedback\\n- Focus on the issue, not the person\\n\\n## Questions?\\n\\n- 💬 Start a [Discussion](https://github.com/yourusername/ai-blog-platform/discussions)\\n- 📧 Email: your-email@example.com\\n- 🐦 Twitter: [@yourusername](https://twitter.com/yourusername)\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Thank you for making this project better! 🙏**\\n"}', 'logfire.msg': 'running tool: create_file', 'logfire.json_schema': '{"type": "object", "properties": {"tool_arguments": {"type": "object"}, "tool_response": {"type": "object"}, "gen_ai.tool.name": {}, "gen_ai.tool.call.id": {}}}', 'logfire.span_type': 'span', 'original_content': '', 'tool_response': 'Successfully created CONTRIBUTING.md.'}
