2026-02-03 08:53:24.268 | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "create_file", "args": "{\"file_path\": \".env.example.hetzner\", \"initial_content\": \"# Hetzner Deployment Environment Variables\\n# Copy this to .env on your server\\n\\n# WordPress Configuration\\nWORDPRESS_API_URL=https://your-wordpress-site.com/wp-json\\n\\n# AI API Keys\\nOPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...\\nANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...\\n\\n# Site Configuration\\nSITE_URL=https://yourdomain.com\\nSITE_NAME=My AI Blog\\nSITE_DESCRIPTION=AI-powered content platform with Clawbot\\n\\n# Monetization (Optional)\\nSTRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...\\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...\\n\\n# Node Environment\\nNODE_ENV=production\\n\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_018WsUusf5qefEACHoKcouh5", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
