h test keys (pk_test_...), switch to live when ready\\nstripe_publishable_key = \\\"\\\"  # Optional: pk_test_... or pk_live_...\\nTEMPLATE\\n\\necho \\\"\ud83d\udcdd Updated terraform.tfvars with OpenClaw configuration\\\"\\n\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_012L2LEr6CftkFaLzEU15sdW", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
