ain: `https://battlefield-of-mind.vercel.app`\\n- Battlefield: `https://battlefield-of-mind.vercel.app/battlefield`\\n\\n## 📊 Environment Variables (Optional)\\n\\nAdd these in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables:\\n\\n```\\nNEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-KRCBJY380T\\nNEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://your-domain.vercel.app\\nNEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Battlefield of the Mind\\n```\\n\\n## ✨ What You\'ll Get\\n\\n✅ Interactive 4-section Battlefield journey\\n✅ Auto-save progress\\n✅ Google Analytics tracking\\n✅ Vercel Analytics\\n✅ SEO optimized\\n✅ Framer Motion animations\\n✅ Fully responsive\\n\\n---\\n\\n**All the hard work is done! Just authenticate, push, and deploy!** 🚀\\nEOF\\n"}', 'logfire.msg': 'running tool: bash', 'logfire.json_schema': '{"type": "object", "properties": {"tool_arguments": {"type": "object"}, "tool_response": {"type": "object"}, "gen_ai.tool.name": {}, "gen_ai.tool.call.id": {}}}', 'logfire.span_type': 'span'}
