RL=https://your-domain.vercel.app\\n   NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=MindScape AI\\n   ```\\n\\n5. **Click Deploy!**\\n   Wait 2-3 minutes\\n\\n6. **Done!** Your ultra-modern app is live! 🎉\\n\\n## 📱 What You\'ll See\\n\\n### Home Page (/)\\n- Hero section with dual-theme showcase\\n- Battlefield card (purple/orange gradients)\\n- AI Tools card (blue/cyan gradients)\\n- Synergy section explaining the connection\\n- Blog posts grid (if WordPress configured)\\n- Modern CTA section\\n\\n### Battlefield (/battlefield)\\n- Glassmorphism navigation header\\n- Progress bar showing completion\\n- 4 section navigation pills\\n- Interactive forms with auto-save\\n- Beautiful gradients per section:\\n  - Section 1: Purple/Pink/Red\\n  - Section 2: Blue/Cyan/Teal\\n  - Section 3: Pink/Purple/Indigo\\n  - Section 4: Emerald/Teal/Cyan\\n- Celebration modal on completion\\n- Export/Share buttons\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- Smooth glassmorphism header\\n- Animated logo\\n- Working links with hover effects\\n- Mobile-responsive menu\\n- \\"Start Journey\\" CTA button\\n\\n## 🎯 Key Features\\n\\n### Ultra-Modern Design\\n- Vibrant gradients throughout\\n- Glassmorphism and backdrop blur\\n- Smooth transitions and animations\\n- Modern rounded corners (2xl, 3xl)\\n- Hover effects with scale transforms\\n\\n### Gen Z Aesthetics\\n- Bold, vibrant color schemes\\n- Large, readable typography\\n- Generous spacing\\n- Interactive elements\\n- Mobile-first responsive design\\n\\n### Synergized Themes\\n- Battlefield = Mental Transformation\\n- AI Tools = Content Creation\\n- Both work together for holistic growth\\n\\n## 🔧 Technical Details\\n\\n### Technologies Used\\n- Next.js 14 with App Router\\n- Framer Motion for animations\\n- Lucide React for icons\\n- Tailwind CSS for styling\\n- TypeScript for type safety\\n\\n### Build Status\\n- ✅ Linting: Passed\\n- ✅ Type Checking: Passed\\n- ✅ Build: Success (11/11 pages generated)\\n- ✅ Bundle Size: Optimized\\n\\n## 🎊 After Deployment\\n\\nYour URLs:\\n